                    {
                        "sense_id": "69679d32-5ce0-37e0-92ec-63df18fcf2da",
                        "entry_id": "35d2b349-507f-37d8-8f5c-7bdab2c2dbaf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gladen, or other species of Iris."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8926059-b757-4999-ac48-ce1b0bf9e73f",
                                "sense_id": "69679d32-5ce0-37e0-92ec-63df18fcf2da",
                                "text": "In one district of Stronsa, I observed several acres covered with the common yellow flag, or seg (iris pseudacorus,) of which a very coarse kind of hay is here made."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfe5ed86-d06c-488f-9df6-da9c1c620420",
                                "sense_id": "69679d32-5ce0-37e0-92ec-63df18fcf2da",
                                "text": "It's also believed that anyone who bites a seg will develop an impediment of speech, such as a stammer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c00c23d9-0dc2-4c7a-be62-ea013db44e62",
                                "sense_id": "69679d32-5ce0-37e0-92ec-63df18fcf2da",
                                "text": "Boats were made of wood, paper or segs (the leaves of the yellow flag). For some reason, children in Stenness (O) were warned that if they chewed seg leaves they would become dumb."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
